      "message": "test(post): regenerate the Carvera NC goldens for the clearance Z before X/Y after M6\n\nThe maintainer approved the regeneration of these 19 goldens in the\nquestion dialog on 2026-11-14. After each M6, the G0 X Y line and the\nG0 Z line change places. No line is added or removed.\n\nRefs #1616\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.2 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
